{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24070","headline":"洛阳春赠刘李二宾客 · 白居易","name":"洛阳春赠刘李二宾客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水南冠盖地，城东桃李园。\n雪消洛阳堰，春入永通门。\n淑景方霭霭，游人稍喧喧。\n年丰酒浆贱，日晏歌吹繁。\n中有老朝客，华发暎朱轩。\n从容三两人，藉草开一尊。\n尊前春可惜，身外事勿论。\n明日期何处，杏花游赵村。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}